<title>INDIA: India Mata  MATASEC for 11.86 pct bid at auction.</title>
<headline>India Mata  MATASEC for 11.86 pct bid at auction.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian money market dealer Mata Securities  MATASEC said it recommended bidding at 11.86 percent or lower at Wednesday's six-year government of India securities auction.</p>
<p>The auction, to raise a notified amount of 30.0 billion rupees, is scheduled for Wednesday evening.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22 265 9000</p>
</text>
